<%= pluralize(@messages.size, "possible inquiry") %> from the last 7 days may be missing a lead.
Review each thread and link or create a lead if needed:
<% @messages.each do |message| %>

<%= (message.inbound_received_at || message.sent_at || message.created_at).in_time_zone.strftime("%b %-d") %> - <%= message.subject.presence || "(no subject)" %>
